BEYOND THE 8 FORMAL ITEMS (every web region reproduced — covenant #2/#5)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WeekSelector (Sections):        prev/next TSButtons, calendar + week label, "Current" TSBadge, next .disabled
                                on current week.
SummaryHeroCards (Sections):    Distance / Drives / Energy / Charging Cost / CO2 highlight cards (each TSDelta
                                trend, lower-is-better inverted for Energy + Cost) + conditional Fun-Fact card.
DrivingSection (Sections):      daily-distance TSBarChart (TSChartContainer, own empty state) + weekday axis,
                                4 mini-stats, Top-Drive card with date/distance/duration/efficiency or empty.
ChargingSection (ChargingSections): daily-energy TSBarChart + weekday axis, 4 mini-stats, energy-vs-last-week
                                TSBadge chip.
BatteryHealthSection (ChargingSections): 2 BatteryPills (threshold-tinted), 3 mini-stats (charge gain / sessions
                                / est range added).
AlertsSection (Charts):         count TSBadge, severity rows (tinted icon + count badge) + alert-distribution
                                TSPieChart (TSChartContainer), OR no-alerts TSEmptyState.
WeekOverWeekSummary (ChargingSections): 6 comparison StatCards each with a color-correct TSDelta trend.
States: every data source's loading (skeleton/redaction) / empty (page-level + per-section: no-daily-distance,
        no-top-drive, no-alerts) / error / success path implemented — never a blank region.
Units : SI on disk (meters / seconds / watt-hours / Wh-km / watts); display converts at the boundary via the
        shared Units facade (distance + efficiency follow the unit preference; energy kWh, power kW, CO2 kg,
        battery % per the web). a11y: accessibilityElement/Label/Value on panels, pills, charts; adaptive
        macOS (regular) vs iOS compact via horizontalSizeClass; light/dark via design tokens.

